---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const CONTACT_EMAIL = "dev.solanki.works@gmail.com";
const lastUpdated = "August 17, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — How Rich Is Too Rich"
  description="How Rich Is Too Rich privacy policy: what data we collect, how ads and analytics work, and your choices."
  path="/privacy-policy"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink/50">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">The game itself</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      How Rich Is Too Rich runs entirely in your browser. Your shopping choices, purchase log, and
      any "high score" are stored only in your browser's local storage on your own device. None of
      it is transmitted to us or any third party, and we don't ask you to create an account or
      submit any personal information to play.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Advertising & analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This site may display ads served by Google AdSense and use Google Analytics to understand
      traffic. These third parties may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on
      your prior visits to this and other websites, and to measure site usage. You can opt out of
      personalized advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>
      or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Advertising and analytics providers may set cookies in your browser. You can control or
      delete cookies through your browser settings at any time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Children's privacy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect personal
      information from children.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      We may update this policy occasionally. Material changes will be reflected by updating the
      "Last updated" date above.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="font-mono text-amber underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>